{"id":"herod-c","name":"Herod-C","type":"Auto Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/cde164ce6c8756f293b6cc3cee5ed56a.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/1788603939.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Perpetual Motion","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8b9a4582016210723532907414759e69.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus stability, handling, and reload speed while the wielder is in motion."},{"name":"Fourth Time's the Charm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a5edd4e751e1aa34bf8328a63b121e71.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return two rounds to the magazine."},{"name":"Hip-Fire Grip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b481f0ed53a3ae0b31a370d115a06860.png","desc":"Increases accuracy, stability, and precision hit targeting when firing from the hip."},{"name":"Auto-Loading Holster","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e4262099a1c2cea78b48a6680c5248c9.png","desc":"The holstered weapon is automatically reloaded after a short period of time."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Heating Up","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/39d2032b3c5bc7a5b2fe391c64ccb7db.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon increase accuracy and stability while improving vertical recoil."},{"name":"Ensemble","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/421d6325598857bc63c1df0f25607cde.png","desc":"Improved handling and reload speed when allies are nearby."},{"name":"Shoot to Loot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e8c6e23afe3c4215f0dc0c2941500c28.png","desc":"Shooting an Orb of Power picks it up. Shooting an ammo brick picks it up and automatically reloads all of your equipped weapons from reserves."},{"name":"Dynamic Sway Reduction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/36091de4dd029fb6e6ab95dbc612ff05.png","desc":"Improves accuracy and stability while continuously holding down the trigger."},{"name":"Steady Hands","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ed60dd27f28737cbfc77bf41c3784c01.png","desc":"Kills provide improved handling for all weapons for a short duration."},{"name":"Compulsive Reloader","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ef5843dfe8134c7385945216ece2bb06.png","desc":"Grants increased reload speed when close to full magazine."},{"name":"Stats for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8aadd7fd25c2b1e9f3fc7f4411a97ea4.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases weapon handling, stability, reload, and range for a moderate duration."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Focused Fury","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/15fb47018719c99ae37d10f794bc957e.png","desc":"Dealing a portion of the magazine as precision damage grants this weapon bonus damage. The shot count is reset whenever the weapon is reloaded or stowed."},{"name":"Turnabout","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/02786692ea8de976f059b01b4450a67e.png","desc":"Using this weapon to break the shield of a combatant or a Guardian using their Super will grant you an overshield."},{"name":"Headstone","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3a705de0f526aea681a5ffd99b400ab8.png","desc":"Precision final blows spawn a [Stasis] Stasis crystal at the victim's location."},{"name":"Tap the Trigger","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a7840da2970b4137a333fb187477dfe0.png","desc":"Grants a short period of increased stability and accuracy on initial trigger pull."},{"name":"Unrelenting","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1e5843177c71ae3f2a4770d01a2f3813.png","desc":"Rapidly defeating targets triggers health regeneration. Guardians and powerful combatants count as more than one kill."},{"name":"Elemental Capacitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e455d94dcafdab7a0d5a850712908020.png","desc":"Increased stats based on the currently equipped Super.\n• [Solar] increases your reload speed.\n• [Arc] increases handling.\n• [Void] increases stability.\n• [Stasis] moderately controls recoil and increases movement speed when aiming down sights.\n• [Strand] increases airborne effectiveness."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Multikill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3749921a74a378259228d5e989459311.png","desc":"Reloading grants increased damage based on the number of rapid final blows made beforehand."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Gun and Run","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5011e479f02ede344fb16099cfecd800.png","desc":"Defeating targets builds stacks of Gun and Run for a short duration. Sprinting for a short time consumes a stack to partially reload this weapon's magazine from reserves; on Bows, this briefly improves draw speed."},{"name":"Häkke Breach Armaments","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c154f7452e72362a34a2eac4baef5604.png","desc":"This weapon deals increased damage against vehicles and constructs.\n\nConstructs include barricades, turrets, Stasis crystals, and other objects created in the field."}]}],"notes":["pandapaxxy (PvE / M+KB / Controller): \"One way you can spec your Herod-C is to create a pseudo-mag through subsistence and demolitionist; or you could breach and clear using subsistence and headstone to rip through groups of enemies; if bosses are your bread and butter having more damage against them and ammo back through fourth time’s the charm can also leverage the high damage and magazine Herod-C can provide you.\". Recommended MW - Reload.","pandapaxxy (PvP / M+KB): \"Taking their slower rate of fire, as well as crit to body damage, and adding in the requirement of having constant line of sight leaves a lot to be desired. But you can make this weapon work for you if you bring up some of its low points. The recoil has to be 100 through Arrowhead Brake to make your life easier. Taking the combination of perpetual motion and tap the trigger also makes shots easier for you. The final bit to add is extra flinch for your enemies via high-caliber rounds.\". Recommended MW - Range or Handling.","pandapaxxy (PvP / Controller): \"Taking their slower rate of fire, as well as crit to body damage, and adding in the requirement of having constant line of sight leaves a lot to be desired. But you can make this weapon work for you if you bring up some of its low points. The recoil has to be 100 through Arrowhead Brake to make your life easier. Taking the combination of perpetual motion and tap the trigger also makes shots easier for you. The final bit to add is extra flinch for your enemies via high-caliber rounds.\". Recommended MW - Stability.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 11. PvE first-choice for end-game use. Not the strongest subtype, but worth tucking a roll in case High-Impact Frame ARs ever get some love. Gambit drop, with large perk pools, giving a 1 in 144 chance of getting the two perks you want in the last two columns, before even looking at barrels and mags. Choose barrel and mag depending on your Stability, Handling or Reload Speed preferences. Stats for All and One for All are natural partners. Recommended MW: Stability, Handling or Reload Speed, with Backup Mag or damage-boosting (Minor, Major or Taken Spec) mod.","(??? ???): Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 11. PvE first-choice for end-game use. Not the strongest subtype, but worth tucking a roll in case High-Impact Frame ARs ever get some love. Gambit drop, with large perk pools, giving a 1 in 144 chance of getting the two perks you want in the last two columns, before even looking at barrels and mags. Choose barrel and mag depending on your Stability, Handling or Reload Speed preferences. There are really good options to improve weapon performance in the third column, and Vorpal Weapon builds into the foundry intrinsic perk to do more damage against vehicles, turrets, constructs and Stasis crystals. Recommended MW: Stability, Handling or Reload Speed, with damage-boosting (Minor, Major or Taken Spec) mod.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 11. PvE first-choice for end-game use. Not the strongest subtype, but worth tucking a roll in case High-Impact Frame ARs ever get some love. Gambit drop, with large perk pools, giving a 1 in 144 chance of getting the two perks you want in the last two columns, before even looking at barrels and mags. Choose barrel and mag depending on your Stability, Handling or Reload Speed preferences. There are really good options to improve weapon performance in the third column, and Headstone works well for Stasis builds, with the foundry intrinsic perk providing extra damage against Stasis crystals for dragonfly-like AOE damage. Recommended MW: Stability, Handling or Reload Speed, with damage-boosting (Minor, Major or Taken Spec) mod.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 11. PvE first-choice for end-game use. Not the strongest subtype, but worth tucking a roll in case High-Impact Frame ARs ever get some love. Gambit drop, with large perk pools, giving a 1 in 144 chance of getting the two perks you want in the last two columns, before even looking at barrels and mags. Choose barrel and mag depending on your Stability, Handling or Reload Speed preferences. There are really good options to improve weapon performance in the third column, and Frenzy provides a reliable passive damage-boost. Recommended MW: Stability, Handling or Reload Speed, with damage-boosting (Minor, Major or Taken Spec) mod.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 11. PvE first-choice for general use. Not the strongest subtype, but worth tucking a roll in case High-Impact Frame ARs ever get some love. Gambit drop, with large perk pools, giving a 1 in 144 chance of getting the two perks you want in the last two columns, before even looking at barrels and mags. Choose barrel and mag depending on your Stability, Handling or Reload Speed preferences. There are really good options to improve weapon performance in the third column, and Multikill Clip is a good damage boost perk for non end-game activities. Recommended MW: Stability, Handling or Reload Speed, with damage-boosting (Minor, Major or Taken Spec) mod.","[YeezyGT's WQ] [MW: Stability / Handling] \"Herod-C is one of the strongest 360RPMs we've seen, with fairly solid stock recoil direction, good base stats, and a number of great perk options. You should definitely spec into stability and handling where possible to combat the sluggish feel of 360s, and then there's great options like Frenzy, Vorpal and One-for-All for higher-end content. Hakke Breach Armaments also combos fantastically with Headstone.\" tags:pve","Chevy's S16 Super Pog PvE Loot List. Recommended MW - Handling/Reload"],"estimated":null,"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[0,15,23,38],[0,15,23,42],[0,15,23,43],[0,15,31,38],[0,15,31,42],[0,15,31,43],[0,16,23,38],[0,16,23,42],[0,16,23,43],[0,16,31,38],[0,16,31,42],[0,16,31,43],[28,45],[8,15,23,38],[8,15,23,42],[8,15,23,43],[8,15,31,38],[8,15,31,42],[8,15,31,43],[8,16,23,38],[8,16,23,42],[8,16,23,43],[8,16,31,38],[8,16,31,42],[8,16,31,43],[0,11,23,37],[0,11,23,41],[0,11,23,43],[0,11,24,37],[0,11,24,41],[0,11,24,43],[0,11,27,37],[0,11,27,41],[0,11,27,43],[0,13,23,37],[0,13,23,41],[0,13,23,43],[0,13,24,37],[0,13,24,41],[0,13,24,43],[0,13,27,37],[0,13,27,41],[0,13,27,43],[0,14,23,37],[0,14,23,37,48],[0,14,23,40,48],[0,14,23,41],[0,14,23,41,48],[0,14,23,43],[0,14,23,44,48],[0,14,23,46,48],[0,14,24,37],[0,14,24,41],[0,14,24,43],[0,14,26,37,48],[0,14,26,40,48],[0,14,26,41,48],[0,14,26,44,48],[0,14,26,46,48],[0,14,27,37],[0,14,27,37,48],[0,14,27,40,48],[0,14,27,41],[0,14,27,41,48],[0,14,27,43],[0,14,27,44,48],[0,14,27,46,48],[0,14,31,37,48],[0,14,31,40,48],[0,14,31,41,48],[0,14,31,44,48],[0,14,31,46,48],[0,15,23,37,48],[0,15,23,40,48],[0,15,23,41,48],[0,15,23,44,48],[0,15,23,46,48],[0,15,26,37,48],[0,15,26,40,48],[0,15,26,41,48],[0,15,26,44,48],[0,15,26,46,48],[0,15,27,37,48],[0,15,27,40,48],[0,15,27,41,48],[0,15,27,44,48],[0,15,27,46,48],[0,15,31,37,48],[0,15,31,40,48],[0,15,31,41,48],[0,15,31,44,48],[0,15,31,46,48],[0,16,23,37,48],[0,16,23,40,48],[0,16,